{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":578,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"a63e2ac6-f215-4843-b874-841310c77fc5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351629215,"PostDateInt":1795156527000,"PostDate":"2026-11-20T14:35:27","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"内控业务伙伴（BP）——市场销售业务方向(J14952)","OrgId":3628235,"Org":"集团审计部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["湖北省·武汉市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、业务线风控对接：作为内控部门与市场销售业务部门的固定对接人，建立常态化沟通机制；参与业务部门的重大项目或关键流程，从风控视角提供前置评估与风险防控建议；\n2、业务流程风控建设与优化：针对公司市场、销售、售后等业务领域设计并落地内控制度、业务流程和权限管控体系，梳理核心业务流程，识别关键风险点和关键控制点，针对流程薄弱环节设计有效内控措施，推动控制措施嵌入业务系统运行，推动政策、流程、系统三者一致；针对新业务模式快速输出有效内控建设和风险防控方案；\n3、数字化风控落地：推动市场销售业务领域风险预警指标的自动化监控落地，完善风险预警指标管理机制，提升风险发现的前瞻性和准确度；\n4、内控评价与整改闭环：定期开展内控有效性自评，牵头或参与专项检查、调查、审计配合工作，针对内外部监督检查发现的问题，推动整改落地，形成闭环管理；\n5、内控赋能与培训：面向业务团队开展内控意识培训，塑造和提升内控合规文化。","Require":"1、学历：全日制本科及以上学历，财务、审计、工商管理、经济管理等相关专业优先；\n2、工作年限：8年以上工作经验，其中至少3年以上业务内控或风控BP经验；\n3、行业背景：有市场销售、商务、渠道方向内控BP实操经验，具有大型企业集团/上市公司/半导体行业工作经验优先；\n4、专业知识：具备扎实的内控基础知识，熟悉企业内控基本规范、COSO框架及相关规则；熟悉市场销售业务流程及关键控制点；了解相关商业法规；具有CPA/CIA等职业资格证书的优先；\n5、核心能力：具备较强的风险识别与分析能力、熟练使用各种数据分析工具；具备较强的跨部门沟通与推动力；具备较高的业务敏感度，能快速理解业务逻辑和商业意图，在保持内控独立性判断的同时推动业务高效运转；具备较强的多线并行能力，能够高质量完成多线任务；\n6、具备高度的职业道德与内控人员从业操守。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"8年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-20T14:35:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"90c8f11c-2eff-4092-8656-7823e2a4ea0c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351628737,"PostDateInt":1794988697000,"PostDate":"2026-11-18T15:58:17","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"AI应用工程师(J14949)","OrgId":2295248,"Org":"IT","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["湖北省·武汉市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"负责AI技术在业务场景的落地应用与工程化开发，重点聚焦于智能体（AI Agent）系统的架构设计与开发。将AI能力深度嵌入企业业务流程，精准解决业务痛点，驱动效率与体验提升。作为连接AI技术与业务需求的关键角色，推动AI应用从原型到生产环境的全流程交付，特别是构建具备自主规划、工具使用及多步推理能力的智能体系统","Require":"1.具备出色的业务理解与逻辑分析能力，能将复杂的业务逻辑转化为智能体可执行的流程；\n2.学习能力强，能快速学习并导入新技术，关注AI Agent领域的最新进展；\n3.具备良好的团队协作与沟通能力；\n4.硕士及以上学历，计算机、人工智能、软件工程、电子信息等相关专业；\n5.具备5年以上AI应用项目经验，其中至少2年专注于AI智能体（Agent）开发或复杂AI系统构建。\n6.熟悉主流AI技术：大模型应用、ML/DL、NLP/CV任一方向，熟悉微调/部署/RAG/向量库；\n7.熟练大模型API调用、Prompt设计、Agent/MCP等AI应用开发基本技能；熟悉RESTful API串接与设计，具备将智能体集成到现有业务系统的能力；\n8.具备智能体评估与调试能力：熟悉智能体性能评估指标（如任务完成率、工具调用准确率等），并能使用相关工具进行调试与优化。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-18T15:58:17","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"30e8da8d-2935-403a-9151-dabf9c07aa27","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351627983,"PostDateInt":1794794941000,"PostDate":"2026-11-16T10:09:01","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"企业级SSD产品经理(J14941)","OrgId":700612991,"Org":"企业级固态硬盘产品事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["湖北省·武汉市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位职责\n1. 市场调研与需求分析：\n\t深入了解企业客户需求，进行市场调研和竞品分析。\n\t与客户、销售团队和技术团队紧密合作，收集和分析市场需求。\n\t支持前端市场销售，与客户沟通（包括准备推广材料，拜访沟通）。\n2. 产品规划与设计：\n\t规划企业级SSD产品路线图，含产品组合，利润目标及核心竞争力分析等\n\t与设计和技术团队合作，确保产品设计符合用户需求。\n\t负责合作伙伴的前期筛选，引入，沟通，后期管理及合作。\n3. 市场推广与支持：\n\t制定并执行产品上市计划，主导市场推广策略及客户端推广路演。\n\t提供产品培训和技术支持，确保客户满意。\n\t协同Marcom团队做产品的线上和线下推广以及客户的定向推广。\n4. 产品管理：\n\t负责产品从概念到上线的整个生命周期管理。\n\t协调跨部门资源，确保项目按时高质量完成。\n\t负责产品量产阶段问题的决策以及产品生产相关的合作伙伴协作。 \n","Require":"职位要求\n教育背景：\n\t本科及以上学历，计算机科学、信息技术、商业管理或相关领域。\n工作经验：\n\t5年以上企业级产品管理经验，有成功的产品上市案例。\n\t在企业级存储或服务器行业有丰富经验，熟悉相关市场和技术趋势。\n\n优先条件\n\t10年以上企业级存储的公司经验或者互联网客户行业经验优先。\n\t有互联网公司和国内主要OEM厂商的客户资源的行业内人士优先。\n\t有强自驱力及复杂项目产品协调和沟通能力者优先。\n","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-16T10:09:01","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"e8fe9f17-f6f3-40da-a55d-599f6720a2a6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351627539,"PostDateInt":1794473360000,"PostDate":"2026-11-12T16:49:20","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"Test System Engineer(J14937)","OrgId":700612991,"Org":"企业级固态硬盘产品事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["四川省·成都市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"TSE（Test System Engineer）是测试领域的系统架构师，核心使命是：站在系统应用的整体视角，对企业级SSD进行测试策略设计、测试方案制定和测试质量把关。测试策略制定：基于企业级SSD的应用场景，制定产品级别的测试策略，明确测试范围、深度、优先级、准入/准出标准及风险矩阵。\n测试方案设计：输出系统级测试方案文档，包括测试场景建模、负载画像分析、测试维度正交分解、关键指标定义（性能/可靠性/数据完整性/兼容性/安全性边界）。\n应用场景覆盖设计：针对分布式存储、云存储、数据库、AI训练等不同上层系统，分析SSD的IO特征与行为边界，设计差异化的系统级验证策略。\n测试质量把关：Review测试方案与测试报告的充分性/合理性，识别覆盖率盲区，推动遗漏场景补测；对测试结论进行终审。\n跨团队测试协同：作为测试与硬件/固件/系统软件/客户之间的技术接口，协调解决跨域问题（如OS兼容性、RAID控制器交互、存储软件栈适配等）。\n行业标准与最佳实践跟踪：跟踪SNIA/TCG/NVM Express/PCI-SIG等标准演进，提炼对企业级SSD测试的影响并更新测试策略基线。\n测试资产沉淀：建立并维护企业级SSD测试知识库（场景模型、故障模式库、竞品对比基准），持续迭代。","Require":"本科及以上，计算机/电子/通信相关专业；硕士及以上优先；\n8年以上存储/半导体/FPGA/服务器行业经验，其中至少3年测试架构/测试策略/测试管理方向经验（非纯执行）；\n对企业级SSD产品体系有深度理解（U.2/E1.S/E3.S形态，NVMe 1.4+/2.0，PCIe Gen4/Gen5，TLC/QLC）；\n至少深入参与过2类以上上层系统/解决方案的SSD适配测试（分布式存储、云存储、数据库、AI、虚拟化等）；\n具备体系化的测试方法论：熟悉风险驱动测试、正交实验设计、边界分析、故障注入设计等方法；\n优秀的文档输出能力（测试策略/方案/Risk Assessment），能面向产品团队和客户做技术汇报；\n英语可流畅阅读技术规范（NVMe Spec/PCIe Spec/SNIA文档），具备跨团队协作影响力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"8年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-12T16:49:20","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"8439ddb8-b53d-42b9-9128-32aabc665137","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351627281,"PostDateInt":1794391741000,"PostDate":"2026-